&P365134 = CT 06, pl. 20, Bu 1891-05-09, 0330 
#atf: lang akk 
@tablet 
@obverse 
1. _1(esze3) GAN2 a-sza3 a-gar3_ tap-ti-a-tum 
#tr.ts: ištēn ebel eqlum ugārum taptiātum
#tr.en: A field of 1 eblum in the Taptiātum irrigation district

2. i-na hal-hal-la{ki} 
#tr.ts: ina ḫalḫalla	
#tr.en: at Ḫalḫalla

3. i-ta _a-sza3 aga-us2-mesz_ 
